    "text": "Her stent \u00f0a forwarde \u00f0e \u00c6\u00feeric worhte wi\u00f0 \u00f0an abbode on Niwentune, \u00fe\u00e6t is III sceppe mealtes &\nLeofstan abbot do\u00f0 to \u00feis fermfultum, an sceppe malt & III hund hlafe & VI fliccen & o\u00feer VI to\nOn Elsingtun hundred ah Sancte Eadmund XXVII manslot, on Spelhoge hundred XLV manslot on In\nFram A\u00feolfes su\u00f0tun to alde Walbec, fram Watlingetune nor\u00f0 into s\u00e6 ah Sancte Eadmund landes d\u00e6le\nUres Drihtnes H\u00e6lendes Cristes freo nama a on ecnyssa sy gewur\u00feod, \u00fee \u00e6ngla wuldorheap him sylfum\nSwa he nu dagum Breotanrices f\u00e6gran iglandes Eadwearde cyncge sealde & geu\u00fee ealswa he \u00e6ror\nBet\u00e6hte nu cincg se goda Eadward & se wur\u00f0fulla his m\u00e6ges mynstere on B\u00e6dericeswyr\u00f0e Leofstan\n& he \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feus mycel funde, X bec inne \u00f0\u00e6ra circean IIII Cristes bec & I m\u00e6sseboc & I pistelboc & I\nIn madmhus, XII m\u00e6ssehacelan & nigon canterc\u00e6ppa & IIII roccas & VII stolan & XXXIII pella & IX\nBlakere h\u00e6f\u00f0 I winter r\u00e6dingboc.\nBrihtric h\u00e6f\u00f0 I m\u00e6ssereaf calix & disc & I m\u00e6sseboc & winter r\u00e6dingboc & sumerboc.\nSiuer\u00f0 h\u00e6f\u00f0 an m\u00e6ssereaf & an m\u00e6sseboc & Leofstan an handboc, \u00e6\u00feeric an m\u00e6sseboc & capitularia,\nOn Sancte Eadmundes byrig beo\u00f0 XVI hida eor\u00f0es landes VI hida into \u00fe\u00e6ra byrig & \u00fea X hida manna\nOn Wirlingaweor\u00f0e li\u00f0 anes mon\u00f0es ferme mid \u00fean berwica Saham, on Pallegrafe anes mon\u00f0es ferme\nHer syndon XXX boca ealre on Leofstanes abbodes hafona butan mynsterbec.\nOn Paccenham anes mon\u00f0es ferma mid Stantune.\nHer onstent gewriten hw\u00e6t man funde \u00e6t Eggemere sy\u00f0\u00f0an Cole hit let hic instat conscriptum quid\n\u00d0\u00e6t is VII oxen & VIII cy & IIII feldhry\u00feera & II stottas & V scora sc\u00e6p & XV sc\u00e6p under ealde &\nHoc est seofene boues et ahte uacce et fower pascuales uituli et equi uiles et quinquies uiginti oues et\nHer stant gewriten hw\u00e6t Baldwine abbot h\u00e6f\u00f0 geunnen his gebro\u00fera to caritatem, \u00fe\u00e6t is II mylnegafel\n\u00de\u00e6t healf pund we sculan habban \u00e6t natiuitatem sanct\u00e6 Mari\u00e6 & \u00f0a VI or \u00e6t Sancte Dionisius mess\u00eb &\n\u00d0is is seo caritas \u00fee Baldwine abbot h\u00e6f\u00f0 geunnon his gebro\u00f0rum for Eadwardes sawle \u00fe\u00e6s godan\n\u00de\u00e6t is healf pund \u00e6t his geargemynde to fisce to \u00fean forewardan \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee oftor gemunon on\n& stande \u00feis pund \u00e6fre on Godes est & on Sancte Eadmundes cume her to se \u00fee cume to minon\n\u00deis feoh sceal arisan of Ixewyr\u00f0e \u00fee li\u00f0 into Pakenhame.\n\u00c6t Vuiges gearimynd abbotes we sculan habben half pund to fisce & feowerti penega to mede & II\n\u00d0is is Sancte Eadmundes ferme on Byrtune, IIII met maltes under masc & grut, halmet hw\u00e6te, an ry\u00f0er\nOf Ruham ealswa mycel & of Redgraue ealswa of Pakenham & of Stantune ealswa mycel.\nOf Elmeswelle & of Wulpet & of Grotene ealswa.\nOf Herningwelle & of Cunegestune ealswa mycel.\nOf Palegraue & of \u00f0orpe ealswa mycel.\nOf Horningeseor\u00f0e & of Risby ealswa micel.\nOf Kokefelde & of Ceorleswur\u00f0e ealswa micel.\nOf Hwepstede & of Bradefelde ealswa mycel.\nOf Wyrlingwur\u00f0e & of Saham ealswa mycel.\nOf Rungetune & of Culeforde & of Fornham ealswa mycel.\nOn Brokeforde & of Rikingehale ealswa mycel.\nOf Tifteshale I met maltes under masc & grut & I lepene hw\u00e6te & feor\u00f0end\u00e6l an ry\u00f0er & an half swin",
